  "schema_type": "SceneBehaviorGraph",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "name": "scene_09_case_05 invalid requirement golden",
  "description": "负向 benchmark：Agent 应报告目标与场景事实冲突，不硬编成功运行图。",
  "source": {
    "kind": "benchmark_golden",
