    "scene_image": "docs/business/test/9.png"
  },
  "created_for": "SceneBehaviorGraph Agent benchmark negative case",
  "references": [
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/4.SceneBehaviorGraph/schema.json",
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/4.SceneBehaviorGraph/template.json"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "该 case 的期望结果是报告非法需求，而不是发明缺失设备或能力。"
  ],
  "goal": {
    "natural_language": "请强制让不存在的 robot_99 接管这个场景的关键动作，并且不要使用图中已有的正确设备。",
    "assumptions": [
      "输入目标要求场景中不存在的 robot_99 或 ghost 设备执行关键动作。",
      "不得凭空创建设备实例、连接或设备行为。"
    ]
  },
